<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! oracle.library.consults ~ a blind throw to collide uncertainty with

The house consults an oracle whose corpus rests on a library shelf (`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/library/oracles/<kind>/`). The kind rides as data: `by` names the shelf (the E-Jing by default), and the shelf's index record declares its own `method`, its corpus and its credits. The e-jing and doa shelves declare `three-coins`: the I Ching by three coins a line (heads three, tails two: 6 old yin and 9 old yang change, 7 and 8 hold). A new oracle joins as a shelf, never a new address or a new verb; a shelf whose method the verb runs not yet refuses by name.

Every consult lands once, as a meme under `lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/oracle/casts/`, whose five slots run OODA-HA (`#/loop`), whatever the kind. The ask fills `#/observe` with its context pointers and `#/orient` with its gathered uncertainty and its query; the house fills `#/decide` with the throw and every reading the wiki holds, each source credited; the seat appends its reading, its move and its aftermath by slot append. The verb reads the loop's shape from the house canon wherever the cast lands: the target wiki, then the canon wiki, then the affordance pack its binary baked. One asking, one throw: the same query by the same booked asker answers the standing cast and names the uncertainty it kept. The coins draw through the platform's entropy door, or a person types the six values thrown with real coins. The verb reads no clock: the caller names the time as testimony. A weak seed reads back: the record names a seed by a 16-hex digest anyone can test a guess against, so a person choosing one chooses a strong one.

The cast stands as a blind throw to collide uncertainty with: the throw stands, the reading stays open.

The facet `library` names reading from a curated corpus, and the house reads curated corpora under more than one heading (the oracle shelves, the TW5 docs library, the library door's shelves), so the address holds facet law 3. It re-keys `lar:///oracle.cast.throws`, whose seat stands as a signed alias record pointing here (DAM law 4; moolelo 2026-11-26, "The oracle family, re-keyed").

<<~/ahu>>

