!! shows ~ first-cast · with-pointers · by-doa · replay · a-hand-throws · fresh

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`first-cast` params=`recipe/default asking/[[which lane lands first]] uncertain/[[two lanes both ready; the floor runs one at a time]] ~ a seat's cast at its own open fork`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`with-pointers` params=`recipe/default observe/[[lar:///ha.ka.ba/kahua/memory/plan/cap-memes spirit/affordance-weaver]] uncertain/[[the seat cannot seat a bare root in canon]] asking/[[stable seat or siting change]] ~ the arm's records ride #/observe`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`by-doa` params=`recipe/default by/doa asking/[[which lane lands first]] ~ the DOA's shelf answers, its own method declared on its index`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`replay` params=`recipe/default asking/[[which lane lands first]] then/[[tiddler.get.reads]] ~ the same words answer the standing cast, with the uncertainty it kept`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`a-hand-throws` params=`recipe/default coins/[[7,8,9,6,7,7]] ~ a person's six lines, bottom first, thrown with real coins`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`fresh` params=`recipe/default asking/[[which lane lands first]] fresh/true ~ a person asks the same words anew`>>
```

