!! takes ~ container · face · at · by · asking · uncertain · observe · caster · coins · fresh · seed · nonce

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/container`>>
<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`at` params=`takes/time needs/always skins/mcp,tw5,console ~ the time of the cast, as testimony; the cli reads it once`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`by` params=`takes/kind default/e-jing skins/cli,mcp,console ~ the shelf consulted, library/oracles/<kind>/; its index declares the method`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`asking` params=`takes/words needs/seat ~ the query, named before the throw; the same words answer the same throw`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`uncertain` params=`takes/words ~ the gathered uncertainty, in any words; fills #/orient at the first throw`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`observe` params=`takes/pointers ~ the records, hashes and branches the arm holds; fills #/observe at the first throw`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`caster` params=`takes/name default/operator ~ who cast, as annotation; the throw keys on the booked asker`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`coins` params=`takes/six-values gate/hand ~ six line values of 6 to 9, bottom first: a person's own throw`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`fresh` params=`gate/hand ~ a new throw for the same words`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`seed` params=`takes/words gate/hand ~ coins drawn from these words; the record names the seed by a 16-hex digest`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nonce` params=`takes/hex gate/hand skins/mcp,tw5,console ~ minted at the word; the cli mints one for a bare cast`>>
```

