!! gate ~ seat-asks · fresh · seed · coins · nonce

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat-asks` params=`who/seat ~ a seat names its query before it casts; a bare seat cast answers asks`>>
<<has entity=`gate` name=`fresh` params=`who/hand ~ a fresh throw rides a person's hand; a seat's answers asks`>>
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seed` params=`who/hand ~ a seeded throw rides a person's hand; a seat's answers asks`>>
<<has entity=`gate` name=`coins` params=`who/hand ~ typed coins ride a person's hand; a seat's answer asks, so a seat never picks the figure`>>
<<has entity=`gate` name=`nonce` params=`who/hand ~ a seat's own nonce re-throws as surely as fresh, and answers asks`>>
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`ocap/admin-on-the-landing-bag ~ the cast lands through the meme door's own gate`>>
```

